<div style="padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px"><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:17px">New inquiry follow-up</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Starts when a new inquiry comes in</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#1E6B3E">verified</span>Approved by your team</span></div>
