<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Customers forget appointments</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Reminders go out on schedule, every time.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Your team types the same messages all day</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Confirmations and notifications send themselves.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
