<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#FBE0D6;color:#A23E1E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#A23E1E">forum</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Text, email, WhatsApp and phone calls</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Each step goes out on the channel that suits your customers.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#FBE0D6;color:#A23E1E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#A23E1E">rule</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Workflows you approve</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Every message runs on rules your team signed off on.</p></div></li>
