<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #2B5C8F"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#2B5C8F">Step 1</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We map the messages you send today</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Confirmations, follow-ups, reminders, and who should hear about what.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#8A5A00">Step 2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We build workflows for your approval</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You see every message and its timing before anything goes live.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#A23E1E">Step 3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">They run automatically</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Each message goes out at the right moment. Steps you mark wait for a person.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #0F6B57"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#0F6B57">Step 4</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">You review, we refine</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We measure the results and adjust the workflows with you.</p></li>
</ol>
